  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$2^{\\frac{3}{2}}=2^{1+\\frac{1}{2}}=2\\cdot2^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\approx2\\cdot1.414=2.828;$",
        "$2^{-\\frac{1}{4}}=2^{-1+\\frac{3}{4}}=2^{-1}\\cdot2^{\\frac{3}{4}}\\approx0.5\\times1.681=0.8405;$",
        "$2^{-\\frac{3}{2}}=2^{-2+\\frac{1}{2}}=2^{-2}\\cdot2^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\approx0.25\\times1.414=0.3535.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们把求出的式 $2^x$ 的值四舍五入到百分位后，填入下面",
        "的数值表："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "表",
      "box": [
        309,
        974,
        1744,
        830
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x$: $-2$，$-1\\frac{3}{4}$，$-1\\frac{1}{2}$，$-1\\frac{1}{4}$，$-1$，$-\\frac{3}{4}$，$-\\frac{1}{2}$，$-\\frac{1}{4}$，$0$，$\\frac{1}{4}$",
        "$y$: $0.25$，$0.30$，$0.35$，$0.42$，$0.50$，$0.59$，$0.71$，$0.84$，$1.00$，$1.19$",
        "$x$: $\\frac{1}{2}$，$\\frac{3}{4}$，$1$，$1\\frac{1}{4}$，$1\\frac{1}{2}$，$1\\frac{3}{4}$，$2$，$2\\frac{1}{4}$，$2\\frac{1}{2}$，$2\\frac{3}{4}$，$3$",
        "$y$: $1.41$，$1.68$，$2.00$，$2.38$，$2.83$，$3.36$，$4.00$，$4.76$，$5.66$，$6.72$，$8.00$"
      ],
      "id": "tbl-p0199-01"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "容易看出，在上表中列出的变量 $x$ 任何一个值对应于式",
        "$2^x$ 一个正值，并且 $x$ 的较大的值对应于式 $2^x$ 较大的值."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来证明，在有理数集合上由公式 $y=2^x$ 给出的函数",
        "具有下列性质："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1) 函数只取正值，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2) 函数是增函数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "性质1的证明 由有理数指数幂的定义得出，$x$ 是任何",
        "有理数时，式 $2^x$ 取正值，也就是说，函数的任何值都是正数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "性质2的证明 设 $x_1$ 和 $x_2$ 是任意两个有理数，并且 $x_2",
        ">x_1$. 我们来证明 $2^{x_2}>2^{x_1}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "大家知道，可以用不同的方法把一个有理数写成整数与"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "192"
      ]
    }
  ]
